  "releaseNotes": "## Changes since 0.5.0\n\n### All packages\n* Update DotExtensions.MsExtensions to 8.5.0\n\n### MsExtensions package\n* Remove Unnecessary Enumerable boilerplate in MsExtensions package @alastairlundy (https://github.com/alastairlundy/EnhancedLinq/pull/38)\n* Add StringSegment First and Last Non predicate Immediate mode extensions @alastairlundy (https://github.com/alastairlundy/EnhancedLinq/pull/35)\n* Add .NET Standard 2.0 support for EnhancedLinq.MsExtensions package @alastairlundy (https://github.com/alastairlundy/EnhancedLinq/pull/34)\n* Add Immediate Mode ``None(StringSegment, Func<char, bool>)`` extension",
